# Routing Conventions

## Adding New Routes
// 1. Lazy import ở đầu file
const NewFeature = React.lazy(() => import('./view/feature-folder/FeatureName'))

// 2. Thêm vào mảng routes
{
  path: '/dashboard/pos/new-feature',
  name: 'Tên hiển thị',
  element: NewFeature,
  exact: true,
}
